                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I was thinking recently about games I had bought but hadn't played very much for one reason or another and thought of little baton. I bought the game as a childhood eager reader of BitF. At the time, I had no sense of rhythm and my reaction skills were poor - a rough combo trying to play. Pleased to report that 10 years of gaming and training as a classical musician have amounted to being somewhat better at the game. Happy 10th Anni to Tadpole Treble.",
